abstract: >-
  Digital Twin ICU is a comprehensive machine learning system containing
  31 pre-trained Random Forest models for predicting postoperative complications
  across 5 surgical specialties (cardiac, abdominal, thoracic, vascular, orthopedic).
  The system predicts 6 universal complications (AKI, delirium, infection, respiratory)
  plus specialty-specific complications with externally validated performance
  on 6,388 patients (VitalDB dataset).

keywords:
  - machine learning
  - postoperative complications
  - surgical prediction
  - random forest
  - external validation
  - healthcare AI
  - cardiac surgery
  - surgical risk prediction

